      "Trans": {"SC":"优质内蒙古龙蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1137253536",
      "Source": "This specially blended food is a favorite of Neovenator. Containing only the finest natural ingredients, it provides them with the balanced nutrition they crave. And with a taste of blood they can't resist, they'll warm up to you in no time! Not intended for human consumption.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这款特制调配饲料是新猎龙的最爱。它仅采用顶级天然原料制成，能为新猎龙提供其所需的均衡营养。饲料中带有的浓郁血腥味让新猎龙无法抗拒，能让它们迅速对你产生好感！ 注意：禁止人类食用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
