    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1557094641",
      "Source": "Squiddige",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鱿鱼糊","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::750999331",
      "Source": "This unusual squid concoction is rather strange. Not only is it the only thing to tame a Hainosaurus with, and baby Hainosaurus' only consume this. As odd as it is, at least the Giant Sea Slug can make it passivly. Humans shouldn't consume this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这款奇特的鱿鱼制品颇为怪异。它不仅是驯服海诺龙的唯一道具，也是幼年海诺龙的专属食物。虽说离谱，但至少海蛞蝓能被动产出它。此物禁止人类食用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
