      "Source": "Fish Cake",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鱼肉糕","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1978848892",
      "Source": "A fish cake is a culinary dish consisting of filleted fish and squid bits. This is the only thing that a Giant Sea Slug will eat. Humans find the taste rather nasty. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这款鱼肉糕是一道由鱼片和鱿鱼碎制成的料理，也是海蛞蝓的唯一食物，人类却觉得这味道十分难吃。","JA":""},
