      "Trans": {"SC":"长尾海豹泰克鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::392250851",
      "Source": "Equip a Acrophoca with this to ride it. When powered by Element, neither you or Acrophoca require oxygen to breathe. You can also turn on a spotlight on the head!<#RN#><#RN#>Using requires learning this Tekgram.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给长尾海豹装备此物，即可骑乘。使用元素充能后，你和长尾海豹都无需氧气呼吸，还能开启头部探照灯！<#RN#><#RN#>使用需先习得对应泰克蓝图。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::410445605",
      "Source": "Angulomastacator Saddle",
