      "Trans": {"SC":"埃德蒙顿龙运输鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1539936887",
      "Source": "Equip a Edmontosaurus with this to ride it. Bring your tribe, up to 8 other people can join you!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给埃德蒙顿龙装备此物，即可骑乘，最多可搭载 8 名部落成员。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1100230308",
      "Source": "Eotriceratops Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"始三角龙鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2532571277",
      "Source": "Equip a Eotriceratops with this to ride it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给始三角龙装备此物，即可骑乘。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2579826792",
      "Source": "Advanced Eotriceratops Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"高级始三角龙鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::174497361",
      "Source": "Equip a Eotriceratops with this to ride it. This special saddle allows Eotrike to ferment Tequila, and make Argil!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给始三角龙装备此物，即可骑乘。该特殊鞍可让始三角龙发酵龙舌兰、制作白黏土。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3256734293",
      "Source": "Gandakasia Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"甘达克鲸鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2415232907",
      "Source": "Equip a Gandakasia with this to ride it. Also allows deep sea smithing!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给甘达克鲸装备此物，即可骑乘，还能在深海制作物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1290094125",
      "Source": "Gomphotherium Armored Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嵌齿象装甲鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1868327251",
      "Source": "If you want your Gomphotherium to be etra protected in battle, this armor will help! However, you can't equip any of the other attachements.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你想让嵌齿象在战斗中获得更多防护，这款装甲鞍可以做到！但无法再装备其他附件。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1061284553",
      "Source": "Gomphotherium Bedroll",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嵌齿象睡袋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1447555171",
      "Source": "This special item allows a player to respawn if they die! It works so well you won't even loose your gear! Does break upon use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该特殊物品可让玩家死亡后在此复活，且不会丢失装备，使用后会损坏。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2782242475",
      "Source": "Gomphotherium Medkit",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嵌齿象医疗包","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3018493455",
      "Source": "This addition for Gomphotherium's saddle helps heal Gomphotherium and reduces stamina consumption!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嵌齿象鞍配件，可帮助其恢复生命值并降低耐力消耗。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4011686528",
      "Source": "Gomphotherium Packs",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嵌齿象驮包","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2591682787",
      "Source": "Equip these saddle bags if you want your Gomphotherium to be able to carry more! Adds a weight reduction too!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"装备后可提升嵌齿象负重能力，还能减免重量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::615710158",
      "Source": "Gomphotherium Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嵌齿象鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2955061385",
      "Source": "Equip a Gomphotherium with this to ride it. There's more then one saddle blanket, see if you can craft then all!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给嵌齿象装备此物，即可骑乘。有多款鞍垫，尝试全部制作出来！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2810716500",
      "Source": "Equip a Gomphotherium with this to ride it. This one has a pretty cyan knitted blanket!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给嵌齿象装备此物，即可骑乘。这款配有漂亮的青色针织鞍垫！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4120196094",
      "Source": "Equip a Gomphotherium with this to ride it. The green blanket almost looks like camo!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给嵌齿象装备此物，即可骑乘。绿色鞍垫看起来酷似迷彩！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3059186501",
      "Source": "Equip a Gomphotherium with this to ride it. My personal favorite! It's got flowers and vines on it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给嵌齿象装备此物，即可骑乘。这是我个人最爱！上面有花朵与藤蔓！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
